 r"I would bring Nuffield Health strong SQL, Excel and Power BI skills, experience building KPI dashboards and performance reporting, a solid understanding of healthcare data, and the habit of explaining performance clearly to finance and non-finance colleagues. I have the right to work in the UK until January 2029 without sponsorship. I am based in London and happy to work from the Barbican office.",

